{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "tags": ["yescare", "capacity", "tier0-tier1"],
  "title": "YesCare — Tier 0→1 Capacity Signals",
  "uid": "yescare-tier-capacity",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Datasource",
        "multi": false,
        "name": "datasource",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "type": "datasource"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this board",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Tier 0→1 trigger:** move to Tier 1 (add Postgres standby + bump DB size, turn on control-plane HA) when any of these are **sustained** (days, not spikes):\n\n- **DB pool utilization > 70%** (top-left) — the #1 signal; Postgres saturates first at Tier 0.\n- **DB connections queued > 0** — threads waiting for a connection.\n- **p95 latency > 500ms** breaching SLO.\n- **RPS** trending toward your Tier 1 baseline (~1K concurrent).\n\n⚠️ **Postgres / node CPU is NOT on this board** — managed-DB & node host CPU live in **DO monitoring** (see `do-native-capacity-alerts.tf.example`). Watch DO's DB CPU > 70% as the authoritative Tier-1 trigger."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "DB Pool Utilization (max across services)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max( max(hikaricp_connections_active{namespace=\"prod\"}) by (app) / max(hikaricp_connections_max{namespace=\"prod\"}) by (app) )",
          "legendFormat": "pool util"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.7 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.9 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Request Rate (RPS, cluster)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{namespace=\"prod\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "rps"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 100 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 250 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "P95 Latency (max service)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max( histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"prod\"}[5m])) by (le, app)) )",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx Error Rate",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{namespace=\"prod\", status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{namespace=\"prod\"}[5m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "5xx"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.01 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "DB Connection Pool — active vs max & pending (by service)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max(hikaricp_connections_active{namespace=\"prod\"}) by (app)",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}} active"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max(hikaricp_connections_max{namespace=\"prod\"}) by (app)",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}} max"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max(hikaricp_connections_pending{namespace=\"prod\"}) by (app)",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}} pending"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "P95 Latency by Service",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 9 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"prod\"}[5m])) by (le, app))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request Rate by Service (RPS)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{namespace=\"prod\"}[5m])) by (app)",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "JVM Heap % by Service",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_used_bytes{namespace=\"prod\", area=\"heap\"}) by (app) / sum(jvm_memory_max_bytes{namespace=\"prod\", area=\"heap\"}) by (app)",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.85 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.95 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
